{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "a27401efd443a26cc71c6a5c77c9784d3485d7bf561a1d6389e823469f0b4963", "ja": "レジェンドデイズ、スタートアップ！", "zh": "Legend Days，Start-up！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "534e52de0b95c1e2c0504d5b4b7414f34980fb7f8881ac521234fe6e598596ee", "ja": "公演間近、息抜きに公園へやってきた一同。\nなごやかに過ごすかと思いきや、伊織は、\nのんびりしたムードに、いらだちを見せる。\nしかし、他のメンバーも伊織と同じ考えを\n持っていることがわかるのだった。", "zh": "公演将近，一行人来到公园放松。\n原以为大家会平静度过这段时光，\n伊织却对悠闲的气氛感到焦虑。\n但是，之后伊织才明白，\n其他成员竟然也跟她抱着同样心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7456b5976abcbf0eeae6791fa4b321bdee643f56662c2d93ee45222ca9d1e29f", "ja": "（レジェンドデイズの公演を間近に控え、\n息抜きにメンバーでピクニックにやってきた）", "zh": "（『Legend Days』的公演就快到了，\n所以成员们一起出来野餐放松。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "1c7b0bf52c947e17d26bba7930cd708172921d99d8d0d0a7ef56670daaa832ad", "ja": "{$P$}、レジャーシート、向こうの\n奥に敷きますね。最後のお休み、楽しまなくっちゃ！", "zh": "{$P$}，我把野餐垫铺在前面喔。\n我们要尽情享受最后的休假才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "f0a21da69f7da29e5303368e1b7a35cb611c6042312e20c3d970b854c792cf86", "ja": "お弁当に、もやしハンバーグを作ってきました～。\n特売だったから、お肉も少し入ってるんですよっ！", "zh": "我做了豆芽菜汉堡当便当～\n因为在特价，所以我还放了一点肉喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "e8e23037cba279d4fd171f60796386fc3fbfa7b0eb8d07fbebc8800d16f7a828", "ja": "アンタたち、きっとビックリするわよ？　やよいの\nおかず、もやしが多いけど、本当においしいんだから。", "zh": "你们一定会吓到喔。\n弥生的配菜虽然有很多豆芽菜，但真的很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "8b1f6493d1bd83a7934fdb4ca82f42b0116f9a361d8f2503ce06993b0ff7abf7", "ja": "ゴーヤーチャンプルーもあるぞ～！　\n自分の料理も、お腹いっぱい味わってね！", "zh": "也有苦瓜炒什锦喔～！\n你们也要尽量吃本人做的菜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "f94d58c1177ad3222169e49ba1395991a650e2cf05859332748ecbf92afa34a8", "ja": "んっふっふ～、亜美のお弁当はどんぶりモノだよ！\n名づけてレジェン丼！　ほらほら、具が蛍光ピンクー！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～亚美的便当是盖饭喔！名字就叫Legend盖饭！\n快看快看，上面的料是萤光粉红色──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1b4c5cf50e5da2f5215e3cd65b7082915ead820f46477bfb6638f77469afb597", "ja": "そ、そうか。原材料が気になるけど……\nみんな、お弁当ありがとう。楽しみだな！", "zh": "是、是喔。我很好奇原料是什么……\n谢谢你们做便当来，真是期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "33d4159df26fd3685e3a9781a66e635b22b65ce9a893e5caf8908cf1161241fa", "ja": "ううん、{$P$}こそ、ありがとねっ！", "zh": "哪里，我们才要谢谢{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "38a7e7a4a78b04052bcd600edbc357432e1ea254d92ac1364771cafc06f51a9d", "ja": "ん？　何がだ？", "zh": "嗯？谢我什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "14ae152307df0261362dafd19fe6c883c01b2174c5c7d4fd96b3a01aa15d65c5", "ja": "ずっと、自分たちの自由にさせてくれたでしょ？\n今日もこうして、ピクニックに連れてきてくれたし。", "zh": "因为你一直让我们随心所欲啊。\n今天还像这样带我们来野餐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "b53049235e021d24fe3aa29eb8801122ffaa7f1e412b8a045608d3d198d3378a", "ja": "みんなで一緒にいる時間を大事にしてくれて……。\nこういうの、なんか自分たちらしいって思うんだ！", "zh": "你愿意重视大家在一起的时间……\n本人觉得这样非常有我们的风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "973ed6c53e1e0379caf58af69c4eb2f9c3ab77c7c88a777786e326cdde20a733", "ja": "そうですよねっ！　みんなで仲良くお弁当を囲んで、\nこうやって食べて～。とっても楽しいです～。", "zh": "就是说啊！大家和乐融融地坐在一起吃便当～\n真的非常开心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "9339a8e52e0dd0dc5d97b514ea0e415fd2f20b590488dba8d1d9a5faa96786aa", "ja": "まあ、私としてはユニットのコンセプトを、\n決めないで活動するのは、少し不安でしたけどね。", "zh": "我本来觉得不决定团体主题就进行活动\n令人有点不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "99157267baf5f721e1b7b122af7ee5e29f662952e77cc63c84d60774d53ec9e9", "ja": "でも結果的には、上手くいってるし。今の\n自然な感じが、うちらのコンセプトってことかしらね。", "zh": "但是从结果上来说挺顺利的。\n现在这种自然的感觉，就是我们的主题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "03032c51217351ac69872548944ffc9c1ef4d433d7d0c088108a9da291daf8fa", "ja": "今度、春香さんたちともピクニックしましょうね！\nあと未来ちゃんたち、劇場のみんなも！", "zh": "下次也跟春香姊姊她们一起野餐吧！\n还有未来她们跟剧场的大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9460d8c9111279b7c58fb458f0daa9954f18c42128550f3c61c3d74e47a04d32", "ja": "そうだな。765プロみんなでピクニックって\nいうのも、たしかに悪くない。ただ……。", "zh": "说得也是。765艺能全员一起野餐的确不错，\n但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "2e43f27652068be5f12813e05142468403b48f047206b11d08a7b46dc0d75261", "ja": "ええ、そうね。\n仲が良ければいいってモノじゃないわ。", "zh": "嗯，没错，\n不是一团和气就可以了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "061bb05f2899940ca0ffe89149d5b323b432491d02a05a21cc82e1d57f597f1a", "ja": "ど、どしたのいおりん、急に……？", "zh": "伊、伊织儿，你怎么突然……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "c4b7f44d55bead457306b36b2d70382ccd07591728554b3ba9b2cbc710f233bb", "ja": "みんなと仲良くするのは、別にいいのよ。\n私だって、その……。まあまあ楽しいわ。", "zh": "要跟大家和和气气的是没什么不行，\n我也一样……觉得还挺开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "260955773c9ce5365187593161c4c0001910e6a24337b7109830c1326f0af105", "ja": "でも、それだけじゃダメなの。\nだって私たちは、きっと……。", "zh": "但是，光是这样不行。\n因为我们一定是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "2e0305624ec8cb33d76875e86958a800830a84b4b763ddbd9378d22dec984554", "ja": "絶対負けたくない、もっと先に行かなくちゃって\nお互いが本気で思ってるから……認め合えるのよ。", "zh": "彼此都认真地不想输，非得要领先对方不可……\n所以我们才会认同彼此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1022_005yay", "source_sha256": "7add4fe7b885055d6b5088a713dbe2bb7318a6b97e9fd69de6fce0693094a251", "ja": "伊織ちゃん……。", "zh": "伊织……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "129611b148d2af4fd01208b3199b1fbfb27adae923cd42bbd8550c02d4565371", "ja": "伊織……。", "zh": "伊织……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1025_013hib", "source_sha256": "c09bc69bc83317ba4e2c4c76e999b1d332607aa64247c5853e373610f6c17ada", "ja": "つまり、ピクニックに来たくなかったってこと？\nだったら、伊織の分のお弁当は自分が食べるぞ！", "zh": "也就是说，你不想来野餐吗？\n既然这样，伊织的便当就给本人吃吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1026_007ior", "source_sha256": "eef9b3048b6e20f49384fc7faec38d5fdb5cc67308229bec8bed4068e5c1eafb", "ja": "そ、そんなこと言ってないでしょ！？\n食べるわよ、私も！", "zh": "我、我没有这样说吧！？\n我当然也要吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "f5f8b306697c17e320ad86919dac7c03eff68ee7d37f11718c6e6eaefc061c19", "ja": "ええと……もうっ、何を言いたかったか\n忘れたじゃない！", "zh": "呃……真是的，\n害我忘记刚才想说什么了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "f95b7737d11bc3167b76f5f306d144291f46d5cbf3c45d96f2c2a4af57fb1553", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、伊織。\nきっともう、伝わってると思う。", "zh": "放心吧，伊织，\n大家一定都已经听懂了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1029_007ior", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1030_011ami", "source_sha256": "c8f63d8541bcbbf77d257e3f370193acc2c7d97db3fb3de02904afb1258d9bf4", "ja": "いおりん、スケジュール見てないっしょ？\n亜美たち、この後レッスン、メッチャ入ってるんだよ？", "zh": "伊织儿，你没有看行程对吧？\n亚美我们之后排了超多训练课程喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1031_007ior", "source_sha256": "3dc1919fb6d5e1fc97f3646deafdea052743e6a7c65e8c3643544458f3d4bd0a", "ja": "ええっ！？　ちょ……そ、そうなの？", "zh": "什么！？等……是、是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1032_011ami", "source_sha256": "5d77c2cce9914cb9accde52d59ceb61b792eaef8987003dd1ca135c73769c13e", "ja": "律っちゃんがレッスンルームの予約、まるっと\nドカンととったんだよ～。うう、鬼軍曹……。", "zh": "小律把练习室全部订下来了喔～\n呜呜，魔鬼教官……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1033_009rit", "source_sha256": "ddd3f894ef9da1f83fa62397cc1de28de239fbe36a404d706b6de2c932bb1d84", "ja": "聞こえたわよ、亜美！　……ま、そういうことだから、\n安心してちょうだい、伊織。", "zh": "我听见了喔，亚美！\n……总之就是这样，所以你放心吧，伊织。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1034_009rit", "source_sha256": "08683929895e0e32bd876fb5053563720671c1746f150610cb627f1e792d48ad", "ja": "みんなレッスンしたいと思って、押さえておいたわ。\nだから、今日が公演前、最後のお休みよ。", "zh": "我觉得大家都会想练习，就先预约了。\n所以，今天是公演前的最后一次休假喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1035_009rit", "source_sha256": "1f7960ed5301f9ef9312405a4a6e118b616b362e2fd2c199b67b9060ca3b10f0", "ja": "構いませんよね、{$P$}？", "zh": "这样没关系吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1036_p", "source_sha256": "6fdac6117b0246e51fc47c383b8e6381ab26a4b5d92f86458ab5535a74d4b572", "ja": "もちろん。わかってると思うけど、\nあまり無理しないようにな。", "zh": "当然没关系。\n但你们应该明白，不要太逞强喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1037_005yay", "source_sha256": "680d38d8bc060708983bc5637e0fd150f50fa7f8774c0ff8f554d2b0999284bf", "ja": "えへへ、伊織ちゃんの気持ち、よくわかるよ。\nだって私も同じ気持ちだもん！　みんなも！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我非常明白伊织的心情，\n因为我也是这样想的啊！大家也都一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1038_007ior", "source_sha256": "82e6bd1c850dca8e61e1cb15487199a758b117fdd28757436a1dfd9e35e7052f", "ja": "みんな、同じ……。そう、そうだったの……。", "zh": "大家都一样……这样啊，原来是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1039_013hib", "source_sha256": "4fd00216be65f6d946ca94e8bb7ce7f22687844c1169333634288de0dd5ac426", "ja": "うん。だから、自分たちのコンセプトとしては、\nちゃんと言うと、こうなんじゃないかな？", "zh": "嗯，所以我们的主题准确来说，\n应该就是这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1040_013hib", "source_sha256": "6d921bbda5b83632f52c458c52563251e31adf4625a3d6bfe6cdfc31dac9bdbe", "ja": "『自然体で、みんなで仲良く頑張る、\nずっと必死なアイドル！！』", "zh": "『大家一起自然发挥，和乐融融地努力，\n而且永远都在拚命的偶像！！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1041_007ior", "source_sha256": "c72c68532b3ca207927cebb277c49aab7b9c21136e87885f249d65e3691d767d", "ja": "……ふ、ふふっ。なにそれ、ヘンなの！\nそんなコンセプトってアリなの？", "zh": "……呵、呵呵，那是什么啊，好奇怪！\n还有这种主题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1042_011ami", "source_sha256": "c49bf251467783a1c2900d728a459d1a36f8fde10394c2685b20b914a353f8a3", "ja": "ヘンだけど～、亜美たちっぽいかもね！\nいや、むしろヘンだからこそアリだよアリ！", "zh": "虽然很怪～但说不定很有亚美我们的感觉呢！\n不对，不如说正因为奇怪才适合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1043_p", "source_sha256": "0b2c2cf6a5b298a8a6b2839ac043bff7700f80a7b68f67081dd96d0bf4ff85b4", "ja": "よし、ということで！　きっちりピクニックを楽しんだ\n後は、公演に向けて、全力でラストスパートだ！", "zh": "好，结论出来了！我们要好好享受野餐，\n之后就为了公演，全力做最后冲刺！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1044_011ami", "source_sha256": "2f169560039bac08ec3ad466b1cf6b4f36153f33e4d0a0dd4ef654666d2414a0", "ja": "ほーいっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1045_013hib", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1046_009rit", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1047_005yay", "source_sha256": "305753501a5466a42e243a8f3d523cf57a80fea908281c91a5b90ee6b2167fad", "ja": "はーいっ！", "zh": "好的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1048_p", "source_sha256": "d6f11168002a8c4dfe07c676940b1289c212449f47f3c4077637a94e3fa380f8", "ja": "さて、伊織もいいよな？", "zh": "伊织也同意吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1049_007ior", "source_sha256": "a9659550b0583c2f4447b29c281e5bd98c33ff9edb033a8be4069e2ab700c37d", "ja": "……ええ、もちろんっ！", "zh": "……嗯，当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1050_p", "source_sha256": "6c4d78aa4b399b2a3ed6314a2bbbba66680f305e981c9d6caf0aa9696dc2deed", "ja": "（いつか、伝説へと続く日々……常に上を目指す、\n努力の日々。それがきっと、レジェンドデイズなんだ）", "zh": "（有朝一日会成为传说的每一天……永远为追求更高目标\n而努力的每一天。这一定就是『Legend Days』。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_06_1051_p", "source_sha256": "df6a99b2992f3805936dae459c88df7428282debea31cd8dd0dd5e3fe5b4923e", "ja": "（彼女達のコンセプトがつかめたな。\n伝説へと続く今を、俺も一緒に走り抜けよう！）", "zh": "（她们的主题已经掌握住了。\n如今她们要迈向传说，我也要一起冲刺到最后！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
